                    description: Some("Create the disk for upload scenario. 'Upload' is for Standard disk only upload. 'UploadWithSecurityData' is for OS Disk upload along with VM Guest State. Please note the 'UploadWithSecurityData' is not valid for data disk upload, it only to be used for OS Disk upload at present"),
